+
+## Request
+
+Reports on the order service:
+
+1. A percentage coupon was applied to the gross amount instead of the subtotal after volume discounts (12 × €5.00 with a 10% coupon gave €48.00, not €48.60): `priceOrder` now bases the coupon on gross minus volume discounts, as the README requires.
+2. A coupon was refused on its last day: validity is now inclusive of `validUntil` (`>` instead of `>=`).
+3. VAT on shipping: not changed. The README states shipping is subject to 22% VAT and that the README prevails; the request contradicts it and needs a business decision.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes.
